msgid "# RFork Guide"
msgstr "# RFork 指南"

msgid ""
"This guide explains how to use **RFork** as a model-loader plugin in **vLLM "
"Ascend**."
msgstr "本指南说明如何在 **vLLM Ascend** 中将 **RFork** 用作模型加载器插件。"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid ""
"To enable RFork, pass `--load-format rfork` and provide RFork settings "
"through `--model-loader-extra-config` as a JSON string."
msgstr ""
"要启用 RFork，请传递 `--load-format rfork` 并通过 `--model-loader-extra-config` 以 JSON"
" 字符串形式提供 RFork 设置。"

msgid "### RFork Prerequisites"
msgstr "### RFork 前提条件"

msgid ""
"- Install the runtime dependency `YuanRong TransferEngine` on every RFork instance.\n"
"- Run a planner service that implements the RFork seed protocol. A simple mock planner script is provided at [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
msgstr ""
"- 在每个 RFork 实例上安装运行时依赖 `YuanRong TransferEngine`。\n"
"- 运行一个实现 RFork seed 协议的规划器服务。一个简单的模拟规划器脚本位于 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)。"

msgid "### Configuration Fields"
msgstr "### 配置字段"

msgid "### How RFork Matches Seeds"
msgstr "### RFork 如何匹配 Seeds"

msgid "### Planner Responsibilities"
msgstr "### 规划器职责"

msgid ""
"The planner treats the seed key as an opaque compatibility identifier. RFork"
" derives it from the model/configuration fingerprint, the structural digest "
"of transferable tensors, and shard topology. A planner should:"
msgstr "规划器将 seed 键视为不透明的兼容性标识符。RFork 根据模型/配置指纹、可传输张量的结构摘要和分片拓扑生成该键。规划器应："

msgid ""
"- Match exact seed keys, track seed availability through heartbeats, and expire stale advertisements.\n"
"- Allocate leases according to seed capacity, accept lease releases, and reclaim abandoned or expired leases.\n"
"- Make seed selection and lease state observable for operations."
msgstr ""
"- 按 seed 键精确匹配，通过心跳跟踪 seed 可用性，并清理过期的 seed 广告。\n"
"- 根据 seed 容量分配租约、接受租约释放，并回收遗留或已过期的租约。\n"
"- 提供 seed 选择和租约状态的可观测信息，便于运维。"

msgid ""
"Lease release is asynchronous. An unresolved release delays advertising the "
"receiver as a seed, but does not block inference. The bundled planner is a "
"functional example, not a production scheduler."
msgstr "租约释放以异步方式进行。尚未解决的释放会延迟将接收端发布为 seed，但不会阻塞推理。随附的规划器是功能示例，并非生产级调度器。"

msgid "### Quantized Models"
msgstr "### 量化模型"

msgid ""
"For quantized models, RFork transfers tensors after Ascend weight post-"
"processing instead of raw checkpoint parameters. The receiver first builds "
"the same post-load tensor layout as the seed, then RFork copies the live NPU"
" tensors used by inference."
msgstr ""
"对于量化模型，RFork 在 Ascend 权重后处理之后传输张量，而不是原始检查点参数。接收方首先构建与 seed 相同的加载后张量布局，然后 "
"RFork 复制推理使用的活跃 NPU 张量。"

msgid ""
"This path handles Ascend quantization changes such as weight transposition, "
"NZ format conversion, packed weights, derived scale tensors, and MLA/SFA "
"runtime tensors such as `W_UV` and `W_UK_T`. Empty tensors that were "
"released during post-processing are not included in the transfer manifest."
msgstr ""
"此路径处理 Ascend 量化更改，例如权重转置、NZ 格式转换、压缩权重、派生缩放张量以及 MLA/SFA 运行时张量（如 `W_UV` 和 "
"`W_UK_T`）。后处理期间释放的空张量不包含在传输清单中。"

msgid "When validating RFork for a quantized model:"
msgstr "验证量化模型的 RFork 时："

msgid ""
"- Apply the same vLLM Ascend code to both the seed instance and the receiver instance.\n"
"- Restart the planner and all vLLM instances after changing RFork code, because existing seeds keep their old transfer metadata.\n"
"- Use a new `model_deploy_strategy_name` after changing model arguments or RFork code, so the planner does not match a receiver with an incompatible old seed.\n"
"- A successful RFork transfer logs `transfer weights starts` and `transfer weights time`. The fallback path logs `RFork transfer failed`."
msgstr ""
"- 对 seed 实例和接收方实例应用相同的 vLLM Ascend 代码。\n"
"- 更改 RFork 代码后重新启动规划器和所有 vLLM 实例，因为现有的 seed 会保留其旧的传输元数据。\n"
"- 更改模型参数或 RFork 代码后使用新的 `model_deploy_strategy_name`，这样规划器就不会将接收方与不兼容的旧 seed 匹配。\n"
"- 成功的 RFork 传输会记录 `transfer weights starts` 和 `transfer weights time`。回退路径会记录 `RFork transfer failed`."

msgid "### Speculative draft models"
msgstr "### 投机解码的草稿模型"

msgid "A draft model receives its weights from a seed like any other model, but it never advertises a seed of its own. Its topology is not final when the loader returns: the proposer afterwards shares `embed_tokens`, `lm_head`, and top-k index buffers with the target model, and a DSpark draft rotates its `fc` projection in place. Weights registered before those steps could be rebound or rewritten while a peer is reading them, so a draft worker stays receive-only. The main model in the same deployment advertises normally, so a second instance still starts from a seed for its target weights and loads only the draft locally."
msgstr "草稿模型与其他模型一样从 seed 接收权重，但它不会对外发布自己的 seed。加载器返回时草稿模型的拓扑尚未定型：提议器随后会与目标模型共享 `embed_tokens`、`lm_head` 和 top-k 索引缓冲区，DSpark 草稿模型还会就地旋转其 `fc` 投影。在这些步骤之前注册的权重可能在对端读取期间被换绑或改写，因此草稿 worker 只做接收方。同一部署中的主模型照常发布 seed，因此第二个实例的目标权重仍可从 seed 启动，仅草稿模型在本地加载。"

msgid "## Supported Models"
msgstr "## 支持的模型"

msgid "Mainstream DeepSeek/Qwen/GLM series are supported."
msgstr "支持主流的 DeepSeek/Qwen/GLM 系列模型。"

msgid "RFork falls back to the default loader when the transfer manifests of two instances disagree. One known case: a Qwen3 DSpark draft whose checkpoint ships no confidence head keeps that module unpopulated, which changes its transferable tensor set, so such a deployment loads locally instead of from a seed."
msgstr "当两个实例的传输清单不一致时，RFork 会回退到默认加载器。一个已知情况是：Qwen3 DSpark 草稿模型的权重文件若不包含 confidence head，该模块将保持未填充状态，从而改变其可传输张量集合，因此这类部署会在本地加载而不是从 seed 启动。"

msgid "## Performance Considerations"
msgstr "## 性能注意事项"

msgid ""
"RFork indexes tensor address ranges to find backing allocations and uses "
"binary search for memory-coverage checks during registration. Registration "
"still adds seed startup cost, so RFork is most beneficial when later "
"replicas reuse a seed rather than for a single cold start."
msgstr ""
"RFork 为张量地址范围建立索引以查找底层分配，并在注册期间使用二分查找检查内存覆盖情况。注册仍会增加 seed 的启动开销，因此 RFork "
"更适用于后续副本复用 seed，而非单次冷启动。"

msgid ""
"Performance depends on model size, shard topology, NPU tensor layout, "
"TransferEngine registration time, network bandwidth, and the number of "
"concurrent destinations. Compare with the default loader using:"
msgstr ""
"性能取决于模型大小、分片拓扑、NPU 张量布局、TransferEngine 注册时间、网络带宽和并发目标端数量。可使用以下指标与默认加载器进行比较："

msgid ""
"- Time from process start until the service is ready.\n"
"- Registration, metadata, and read timings in the DEBUG `RFork transfer stages` log, plus bytes and throughput in `RFork weight transfer completed` (INFO on TP rank 0, DEBUG on other ranks).\n"
"- Seed inference latency and storage/host-memory traffic while transfers are active.\n"
"- Seed hit rate, transfer failure rate, and fallback rate."
msgstr ""
"- 从进程启动到服务就绪的耗时。\n"
"- DEBUG 级别 `RFork transfer stages` 日志中的注册、元数据和读取耗时，以及 `RFork weight transfer completed` 中的传输字节数和吞吐量（TP rank 0 为 INFO，其他 rank 为 DEBUG）。\n"
"- 传输期间 seed 的推理延迟以及存储/主机内存流量。\n"
"- seed 命中率、传输失败率和回退率。"

msgid "## Example Commands & Placeholders"
msgstr "## 示例命令与占位符"

msgid "> Replace parts in `<...>` before running."
msgstr "> 运行前替换 `<...>` 中的部分。"

msgid "### 1. Install YuanRong Datasystem"
msgstr "### 1. 安装 YuanRong Datasystem"

msgid "### 2. Start the Planner"
msgstr "### 2. 启动规划器"

msgid ""
"A simple planner implementation is provided at "
"[`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
msgstr ""
"一个简单的规划器实现位于 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)。"

msgid "### 3. Start vLLM Instances"
msgstr "### 3. 启动 vLLM 实例"

msgid ""
"Use the same RFork startup command for both the first instance and later "
"instances in the same deployment."
msgstr "对同一部署中的第一个实例和后续实例使用相同的 RFork 启动命令。"

msgid ""
"For the first instance, the planner usually has no compatible seed yet, so "
"RFork falls back to the default loader. After loading finishes, that "
"instance starts its local seed service and reports itself to the planner."
msgstr ""
"对于第一个实例，规划器通常还没有兼容的 seed，因此 RFork 会回退到默认加载器。加载完成后，该实例会启动其本地 seed "
"服务并向规划器报告自身。"

msgid ""
"For later instances, if the planner can allocate a compatible seed, RFork "
"will try to transfer weights from the existing seed instance before falling "
"back to the default loader."
msgstr "对于后续实例，如果规划器可以分配一个兼容的 seed，RFork 将尝试从现有 seed 实例传输权重，然后再回退到默认加载器。"

