"- `<served_model_name>`: Service name exposed by vLLM.\n"
"- `<planner_ip>`: IP address or hostname of the RFork planner.\n"
"- `<planner_port>`: Listening port of the RFork planner.\n"
"- `<model_url>`: Stable model identity string used to build the RFork seed key.\n"
"- `<deploy_strategy>`: Stable deployment-strategy name used to build the RFork seed key.\n"
"- `<port>`: Serving port of the vLLM instance being started."
msgstr ""
"- `<model_path>`: 传递给 `vllm serve` 的模型路径或模型标识符。\n"
"- `<served_model_name>`: vLLM 暴露的服务名称。\n"
"- `<planner_ip>`: RFork 规划器的 IP 地址或主机名。\n"
"- `<planner_port>`: RFork 规划器的监听端口。\n"
"- `<model_url>`: 用于构建 RFork 种子键的稳定模型标识字符串。\n"
"- `<deploy_strategy>`: 用于构建 RFork 种子键的稳定部署策略名称。\n"
"- `<port>`: 正在启动的 vLLM 实例的服务端口。"

msgid "## Note & Caveats"
msgstr "## 注意事项与提醒"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid ""
"RFork is a warm-start weight loading path for vLLM Ascend. Instead of always"
" reading model weights from storage, a new instance can request a compatible"
" **seed** instance from an external planner, then pull weights directly from"
" that seed through `YuanRong TransferEngine`."
msgstr ""
"RFork 是 vLLM Ascend 的一种热启动权重加载路径。新实例无需始终从存储中读取模型权重，而是可以向外部调度器请求一个兼容的 **种子** "
"实例，然后通过 `YuanRong TransferEngine` 直接从该种子实例拉取权重。"

msgid "The RFork loading flow in the current implementation is:"
msgstr "当前实现中的 RFork 加载流程如下："

msgid "## Flowchart"
msgstr "## 流程图"

msgid "## Application Scenarios"
msgstr "## 应用场景"

msgid "| Field Name | Type | Description | Allowed Values / Notes |"
msgstr "| 字段名 | 类型 | 描述 | 允许值 / 备注 |"

msgid ""
"| **model_url** | String | Logical model identifier used to build the RFork "
"seed key. | Required for RFork transfer. Instances that should share seeds "
"must use the same value. |"
msgstr ""
"| **model_url** | 字符串 | 用于构建 RFork 种子键的逻辑模型标识符。 | RFork "
"传输必需。需要共享种子的实例必须使用相同的值。 |"

msgid ""
"| **model_deploy_strategy_name** | String | Deployment strategy identifier "
"used together with `model_url` to build the seed key. | Required for RFork "
"transfer. Instances that should share seeds must use the same value. |"
msgstr ""
"| **model_deploy_strategy_name** | 字符串 | 与 `model_url` 一起用于构建种子键的部署策略标识符。 | "
"RFork 传输必需。需要共享种子的实例必须使用相同的值。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_scheduler_url** | String | Base URL of the planner service used "
"for seed allocation, release, and heartbeat. | Required for planner-based "
"matching. Example: `http://127.0.0.1:1223`. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_scheduler_url** | 字符串 | 用于种子分配、释放和心跳的规划器服务的基础 URL。 | "
"基于规划器的匹配必需。示例：`http://127.0.0.1:1223`。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_timeout_sec** | Number | Timeout for waiting until the local "
"seed HTTP service becomes healthy after startup. | Optional. Default: `5.0`."
" Must be greater than `0`. Invalid values fall back to the default. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_timeout_sec** | 数字 | 等待本地种子 HTTP 服务在启动后变为健康状态的超时时间。 | "
"可选。默认值：`5.0`。必须大于 `0`。无效值将回退为默认值。 |"

msgid ""
"1. vLLM starts with `--load-format rfork`.\n"
"2. RFork builds a **seed key** from the model identity and deployment topology.\n"
"3. RFork asks the planner for an available seed matching that key.\n"
"4. If a seed is returned, the new instance initializes the model structure on its local NPU, registers local weight memory, fetches the remote transfer-engine metadata from the seed, and performs batch weight transfer into local parameter buffers.\n"
"5. If no seed is available, or any step fails, RFork releases its registered memory and seed service, then falls back to the default loader. Fallback is conditional on that cleanup succeeding: if registered memory or the seed service cannot be released, RFork raises instead of allocating a second model while the old weights are still pinned.\n"
"6. After the instance finishes loading, it starts a local seed service and periodically reports heartbeat to the planner, so later instances can reuse it."
msgstr ""
"1. vLLM 以 `--load-format rfork` 参数启动。\n"
"2. RFork 根据模型标识和部署拓扑构建一个 **seed 键**。\n"
"3. RFork 向规划器请求一个与该键匹配的可用 seed。\n"
"4. 如果返回了 seed，新实例在其本地 NPU 上初始化模型结构，注册本地权重内存，从 seed 获取远程传输引擎元数据，并将权重批量传输到本地参数缓冲区。\n"
"5. 如果没有可用的 seed，或任何步骤失败，RFork 会释放其已注册内存和 seed 服务，然后回退到默认加载器。回退以该清理成功为前提：如果已注册内存或 seed 服务无法释放，RFork 会抛出异常，而不会在旧权重仍被占用的情况下再分配一份模型。\n"
"6. 实例完成加载后，启动本地 seed 服务并定期向规划器发送心跳，以便后续实例可以复用它。"

msgid ""
"- **Scale-out after a first successful load**: The first instance may still load from storage, but later instances with the same deployment identity can reuse it as a seed and shorten startup time.\n"
"- **Elastic serving clusters**: Because RFork asks a planner for available seeds, it fits clusters where instances are created and reclaimed dynamically.\n"
"- **Topology-sensitive deployments**: RFork derives the seed key from a configuration fingerprint, a structural digest of the built model's transferable tensors, and the shard topology (`tp_rank`, optional `pp_rank`, optional `ep_rank`, and an optional `draft` marker), so only structure- and topology-compatible instances are matched together."
msgstr ""
"- **首次成功加载后的横向扩展**：第一个实例可能仍从存储加载，但后续具有相同部署标识的实例可以将其作为 seed 复用，从而缩短启动时间。\n"
"- **弹性服务集群**：由于 RFork 向规划器请求可用的 seed，因此适用于实例动态创建和回收的集群。\n"
"- **拓扑敏感的部署**：RFork 根据配置指纹、已构建模型可传输张量的结构摘要以及分片拓扑（`tp_rank`、可选的 `pp_rank`、可选的 `ep_rank` 以及可选的 `draft` 标记）派生 seed 键，因此只有结构和拓扑兼容的实例才会被匹配在一起。"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_request_timeout_sec** | Number | HTTP connect/read timeout for "
"planner and seed requests. | Optional. Default: `10.0`. Must be greater than"
" `0`. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_request_timeout_sec** | 数字 | 规划器和种子请求的 HTTP 连接/读取超时时间。 | "
"可选。默认值：`10.0`。必须大于 `0`。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec** | Number | Interval between planner "
"heartbeat reports. | Optional. Default: `30.0`. JSON configuration only. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec** | 数字 | 规划器心跳上报之间的间隔。 | 可选。默认值：`30.0`。仅支持 "
"JSON 配置。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_max_attempts** | Integer | Fast-attempt count before"
" transient lease-release failures continue at a slower background interval. "
"| Optional. Default: `3`. Permanent planner rejection still stops retries. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_max_attempts** | 整数 | 在瞬时租约释放失败转为较慢的后台间隔重试之前的快速尝试次数。"
" | 可选。默认值：`3`。规划器的永久性拒绝仍会停止重试。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec** | Number | Interval between "
"fast lease-release retries. | Optional. Default: `30.0`. JSON configuration "
"only. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec** | 数字 | 快速租约释放重试之间的间隔。 | "
"可选。默认值：`30.0`。仅支持 JSON 配置。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_bind_host** | String | Local address used by the seed HTTP "
"service. | Optional. Default: `0.0.0.0`. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_bind_host** | 字符串 | 种子 HTTP 服务使用的本地地址。 | 可选。默认值：`0.0.0.0`。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_port_base** | Integer | Base port for deterministic seed HTTP"
" endpoints. | Optional. Default: `0`, which lets the OS assign a port. For a"
" nonzero base, main and draft models reserve adjacent slots per worker: main"
" uses `base + 2 * global_rank`, draft uses `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`. "
"Ports above `65535` or ports already in use fall back to OS assignment. Keep"
" this range separate from TransferEngine, its HIXL endpoint range, and other"
" service ports. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_port_base** | 整数 | 确定性种子 HTTP 端点的基础端口。 | "
"可选。默认值：`0`，表示由操作系统分配端口。当基础端口非零时，主模型和草稿模型按 worker 预留相邻的槽位：主模型使用 `base + 2 * "
"global_rank`，草稿模型使用 `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`。超过 `65535` "
"的端口或已被占用的端口将回退为操作系统分配。请将该范围与 TransferEngine、其 HIXL 端点范围以及其他服务端口分开。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_advertise_host** | String | Seed address advertised to the "
"planner. | Optional. Automatically detected when unset. |"
msgstr "| **rfork_seed_advertise_host** | 字符串 | 向规划器公布的种子地址。 | 可选。未设置时自动检测。 |"

msgid ""
"The YuanRong TransferEngine RPC port is not a configuration field: RFork initializes the engine with port `0`, and the\n"
"engine binds and holds an OS-assigned port that RFork reads back via `get_rpc_port()` and publishes as the transfer\n"
"session endpoint. To constrain the engine to a fixed port range (for example, for firewall rules), set YuanRong's\n"
"`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MIN` and `YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MAX` environment variables (both required, valid within `1024-65535` and\n"
"outside the ephemeral range `32768-60999`); invalid values fall back to OS assignment. Keep this range separate from\n"
"the seed HTTP ports and the HIXL endpoint range. The HIXL data-plane endpoints default to base port `22000`\n"
"(`YR_TE_HIXL_BASE_PORT`, 100 ports per physical device), which stays clear of Mooncake ADXL's default `20000`-based\n"
"segments on nodes that co-locate both engines."
msgstr ""
"YuanRong TransferEngine 的 RPC 端口不是配置字段：RFork 以端口 `0` "
"初始化引擎，引擎会绑定并持有一个由操作系统分配的端口，RFork 通过 `get_rpc_port()` "
"读回该端口，并将其作为传输会话端点公布。若要将引擎限制在固定端口范围内（例如为了配置防火墙规则），请设置 YuanRong 的 "
"`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MIN` 和 `YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MAX` 环境变量（两者都必须设置，有效范围为 "
"`1024-65535`，且需避开临时端口范围 `32768-60999`）；无效值将回退为操作系统分配。请将该范围与种子 HTTP 端口以及 HIXL"
" 端点范围分开。HIXL 数据平面端点默认使用基础端口 `22000`（`YR_TE_HIXL_BASE_PORT`，每个物理设备 100 "
"个端口），可避开在同一节点上共存的 Mooncake ADXL 默认基于 `20000` 的端口段。"

msgid ""
"RFork does not match instances by `model_url` alone. The local seed key is "
"derived from three layers:"
msgstr "RFork 不单独通过 `model_url` 匹配实例。本地 seed 键由三个层次派生："

msgid ""
"- a **compatibility fingerprint** over value-semantic configuration,\n"
"- a **structural digest** over the built model's transferable tensors, and\n"
"- the **shard topology**: `tp_rank`, optional `pp_rank`, optional `ep_rank`, a conditional `sharded_dp_rank`, and an optional `draft` marker."
msgstr ""
"- 基于取值语义配置的 **兼容性指纹**，\n"
"- 基于已构建模型可传输张量的 **结构摘要**，以及\n"
"- **分片拓扑**：`tp_rank`、可选的 `pp_rank`、可选的 `ep_rank`、有条件的 `sharded_dp_rank` 以及可选的 `draft` 标记。"

msgid ""
"The compatibility fingerprint covers configuration that changes tensor "
"*contents* without changing tensor *shapes*: the RFork protocol version, "
"`model_url`, `model_deploy_strategy_name`, the resolved model revision, the "
"checkpoint quantization config digest, the architecture list, RoPE settings,"
" the effective P/D role (`kv_role`), and `mix_placement`."
msgstr ""
"兼容性指纹涵盖那些会改变张量*内容*但不改变张量*形状*的配置：RFork "
"协议版本、`model_url`、`model_deploy_strategy_name`、解析后的模型 "
"revision、检查点量化配置摘要、架构列表、RoPE 设置、生效的 P/D 角色（`kv_role`）以及 `mix_placement`。"

msgid ""
"The structural digest is computed from the same transferable tensor set the "
"transfer manifest validates — names, shapes, dtypes, and NPU formats. Any "
"setting that changes tensor structure is therefore captured automatically: "
"weight dtype, TP/PP/EP sharding, NZ and fused MC2 layout switches, "
"quantization post-processing, and speculative draft topology. New Ascend "
"weight-layout switches do not need to be enumerated in the fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"结构摘要基于传输清单所校验的同一组可传输张量计算 —— 包括名称、形状、dtype 和 NPU 格式。因此任何改变张量结构的设置都会被自动捕获：权重 "
"dtype、TP/PP/EP 分片、NZ 和融合 MC2 布局开关、量化后处理以及投机草稿拓扑。新增的 Ascend 权重布局开关无需在指纹中逐一列举。"

msgid ""
"Shard ranks distinguish same-shaped shards: `tp_rank` picks the TP slice, "
"`pp_rank` the pipeline stage, `ep_rank` the expert set (expert weights are "
"same-shaped across EP ranks), and `sharded_dp_rank` the DP position — but "
"only when weight content is actually sharded across the DP dimension. Two "
"deployment forms break DP replication: fine-grained TP "
"(`finegrained_tp_config`) shards selected modules across the DP dimension, "
"and MoE models with `data_parallel_size > 1` shard expert weights across the"
" DP×TP plane — with or without expert parallelism enabled, since with EP off"
" the DP position is the only thing distinguishing same-shaped different-"
"content expert shards. In those cases the DP rank joins the seed key as a "
"shard selector; replicated DP ranks leave it unset and keep sharing one seed"
" pool."
msgstr ""
"分片 rank 用于区分形状相同的分片：`tp_rank` 选择 TP 切片，`pp_rank` 选择流水线阶段，`ep_rank` "
"选择专家集合（专家权重在各 EP rank 上形状相同），`sharded_dp_rank` 选择 DP 位置 —— 但仅当权重内容确实沿 DP "
"维度分片时才参与。有两种部署形态会打破 DP 复制：细粒度 TP（`finegrained_tp_config`）会将选定模块沿 DP "
"维度分片；`data_parallel_size > 1` 的 MoE 模型会将专家权重分片到 DP×TP 平面上 —— "
"无论是否启用专家并行，因为在关闭 EP 时，DP 位置是区分形状相同但内容不同的专家分片的唯一依据。在这些情况下，DP rank 会作为分片选择器加入 "
"seed 键；而被复制的 DP rank 则不设置该字段，继续共享同一个 seed 池。"

msgid ""
"Because the structural digest exists only after the model is built and its "
"memory is registered, the seed key is computed lazily and logged together "
"with the digest right after registration (INFO on TP rank 0, DEBUG "
"elsewhere). A seed miss therefore leaves a debuggable trail of the exact key"
" and digest that did not match."
msgstr ""
"由于结构摘要只有在模型构建完成并注册其内存之后才存在，seed 键是延迟计算的，并在注册结束后立即与摘要一起记录（TP rank 0 为 INFO，其他"
" rank 为 DEBUG）。因此 seed 未命中时会留下可调试的线索，包含未能匹配的确切键和摘要。"

msgid ""
"This means two instances must agree on model identity, tensor structure, and deployment topology before the planner will treat them as interchangeable seeds.\n"
"The final manifest is still validated before transfer, and RFork falls back rather than copying incompatible tensors."
msgstr ""
"这意味着两个实例必须在模型标识、张量结构和部署拓扑上达成一致，规划器才会将它们视为可互换的 seed。\n"
"传输前仍会校验最终清单，RFork 会选择回退，而不会复制不兼容的张量。"

msgid "### Intentional transfer contracts"
msgstr "### 有意设计的传输约定"

msgid ""
"The following behaviors are deliberate RFork protocol choices, not missing\n"
"manifest checks:"
msgstr "以下行为是 RFork 协议有意的设计选择，而非缺失的清单校验："

msgid ""
"- **Dense transpose and reshape:** RFork transfers the one continuous byte range\n"
"  covered by a non-overlapping dense tensor. Before the native read, the receiver\n"
"  may replace its tensor metadata with a storage-preserving view of the seed\n"
"  shape. RFork therefore does not require a separate seed/receiver stride-equality\n"
"  check. Compatible instances are expected to construct the same dense byte\n"
"  order through the fingerprinted configuration and the same post-load path;\n"
"  semantic and physical layout digests are diagnostic evidence for that contract.\n"
"  Gapped or overlapping layouts are still rejected. A new layout implementation\n"
"  that changes byte order must update the compatibility descriptor or extend the\n"
"  transfer protocol instead of relying on the existing dense-view contract.\n"
"- **Processed NZ payload length:** RFork intentionally reads exactly\n"
"  `numel * element_size` bytes for each named tensor, including processed NZ,\n"
"  packed-weight, and derived-scale tensors. Allocation capacity, descriptor-only\n"
"  padding outside the tensor's dense logical range, and adjacent or shared storage\n"
"  are not part of that tensor's payload and are not copied implicitly. A future\n"
"  NPU format that requires bytes outside this range needs explicit manifest and\n"
"  transfer-protocol support; the diagnostic physical-size fields do not silently\n"
"  widen a read."
msgstr ""
"- **稠密张量的转置与 reshape：** RFork 传输由非重叠稠密张量所覆盖的那一段连续字节范围。在执行原生读取之前，接收方可以将其张量元数据替换为保留底层存储的 seed 形状视图。因此 RFork 不需要单独校验 seed 与接收方的 stride 是否相等。兼容的实例应当通过被指纹覆盖的配置和相同的加载后路径构造出相同的稠密字节序；语义布局摘要和物理布局摘要是该约定的诊断性证据。存在空隙或相互重叠的布局仍会被拒绝。若某个新的布局实现改变了字节序，必须更新兼容性描述符或扩展传输协议，而不能依赖现有的稠密视图约定。\n"
"- **处理后 NZ 的载荷长度：** 对每个具名张量，RFork 有意只读取恰好 `numel * element_size` 个字节，处理后的 NZ 张量、压缩权重张量和派生缩放张量同样如此。分配容量、位于张量稠密逻辑范围之外的仅描述符填充，以及相邻或共享的存储都不属于该张量的载荷，不会被隐式复制。未来若某种 NPU 格式需要该范围之外的字节，需要显式的清单和传输协议支持；诊断用的物理大小字段不会静默扩大读取范围。"

msgid ""
"Successful loads log `source=transfer`, `local`, `fallback`, or `shared_target`.\n"
"Successful TP0 weight reads also log transfer elapsed time, bytes, chunks, and\n"
"throughput at INFO; other TP ranks and per-chunk timings remain at DEBUG.\n"
"Every successful registration, receiver-before-read, and final receiver stage\n"
"emits one bounded `RFork tensor layout summary` at INFO per rank. The summary hashes all tensor\n"
"names, shapes, strides, dtypes, NPU formats, logical byte counts, storage byte\n"
"capacities, storage offsets, and NPU descriptor element counts into fixed-size\n"
"semantic and physical digests. It also reports aggregate counts and at most\n"
"three representative tensors, preferring storage views or tensors whose NPU\n"
"descriptor size differs from logical `numel`. Match a receiver's `peer_session`\n"
"to the seed's `session`. Digest differences are diagnostic and do not by\n"
"themselves reject a transfer. On checkpoint-layout transfers, compare\n"
"`receiver_before_read` with `receiver_after_post_load` to determine whether the\n"
"post-load hook rebuilt the layout. Processed-layout transfers instead emit\n"
"`receiver_after_transfer_finalize`, because their layout processing happened\n"
"before the read. The summary does not copy tensor data or prove value equality;\n"
"validate output accuracy separately on NPU hardware.\n"
"Set `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` for per-rank registration, metadata, transfer,\n"
"lease-release, and publication timing."
msgstr ""
"成功的加载会记录 `source=transfer`、`local`、`fallback` 或 `shared_target`。TP0 "
"上成功的权重读取还会以 INFO 记录传输耗时、字节数、分块数和吞吐量；其他 TP rank 以及每个分块的耗时保持在 DEBUG "
"级别。每次成功的注册、读取前的接收方阶段以及最终的接收方阶段，都会按 rank 以 INFO 输出一条有界的 `RFork tensor layout "
"summary`。该摘要将所有张量的名称、形状、stride、dtype、NPU 格式、逻辑字节数、存储字节容量、存储偏移以及 NPU "
"描述符元素个数，哈希为固定长度的语义摘要和物理摘要。它还会报告聚合计数以及最多三个代表性张量，优先选择存储视图或 NPU 描述符大小与逻辑 "
"`numel` 不一致的张量。请将接收方的 `peer_session` 与 seed 的 `session` "
"对应起来。摘要差异仅用于诊断，本身不会导致传输被拒绝。对于检查点布局的传输，可比较 `receiver_before_read` 与 "
"`receiver_after_post_load`，判断加载后钩子是否重建了布局。处理后布局的传输则输出 "
"`receiver_after_transfer_finalize`，因为其布局处理发生在读取之前。该摘要不复制张量数据，也不能证明取值相等；请在 "
"NPU 硬件上单独验证输出精度。设置 `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` 可获得每个 rank "
"的注册、元数据、传输、租约释放和发布耗时。"

msgid ""
"- RFork requires `YuanRong TransferEngine` at runtime. If the package is missing, RFork cannot initialize the transfer backend.\n"
"- If RFORK is used, **each worker process** must bind a listening port. That port is assigned randomly.\n"
"- RFork transfer is bypassed entirely — the model loads through the default loader and no seed is advertised — under any of the configurations below. RFork registers live NPU weight memory and serves it to other instances, so it cannot be used when that memory may later be released or rewritten, nor when expert placement is not fixed at load time. The bypass is decided before any session or TransferEngine setup and is logged as `RFork transfer is disabled when <reason> is enabled; using the default model loader.`\n"
"    - **Sleep mode** (`enable_sleep_mode` on either the model config or `vllm_config.model_config`), because sleeping discards and reallocates weight storage.\n"
"    - **Online weight transfer** (`weight_transfer_config` is set), because weights can be replaced after loading.\n"
"    - **Static expert placement** (`eplb_config.expert_map_path` is set), because the placement map is applied outside the transferred tensor set.\n"
"    - **Dynamic EPLB**, because expert weights and placement can change after the seed service starts. This covers `parallel_config.enable_eplb`, `eplb_config.dynamic_eplb`, and `eplb_config.expert_map_record_path`.\n"
"- Falling back to the default loader requires releasing the RFork seed service and registered memory first. RFork retries that cleanup (`FALLBACK_CLEANUP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`, currently 2, with a short backoff) and only then reclaims memory and reruns the default loader. If cleanup still fails, tensor owners remain pinned and RFork raises rather than allocating a second copy of the model; a session that already reached the finalized state raises as well. Both cases abort startup instead of degrading to a slow load.\n"
"- The example [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) is only a simple mock implementation. If you need stronger scheduling, capacity management, or production-grade availability behavior, implement your own planner based on the RFork seed protocol.\n"
"- The planner protocol headers `SEED_REFCNT` and `SEED_RANK` carry no scheduling meaning, but they are not optional on the wire today:\n"
"    - `SEED_REFCNT` is always sent as `0` on advertisement and is ignored for capacity decisions (seed capacity is controlled by planner configuration). A planner must still accept the header.\n"
"    - `SEED_RANK` remains a **required** field. RFork rejects a `/get_seed` response that omits it or carries a negative value, and sends it on every seed advertisement, lease renewal, lease release, and seed removal request. A planner must echo it back on `/get_seed` and accept it on the other routes. What is deprecated is using it for compatibility decisions: it duplicates the `tp_rank` already encoded in the seed key, so a planner must match on the seed key alone and treat `SEED_RANK` as an opaque part of the seed's identity tuple.\n"
"- Each heartbeat verifies that the seed HTTP service remains alive. If the service exits, RFork stops heartbeats and\n"
"  attempts to withdraw the advertisement while leaving the loaded model available for inference.\n"
"- Temporary planner outages do not stop inference. Retryable initial advertisements and lease releases continue in the\n"
"  background, while permanent planner rejections prevent seed promotion. Outage logs are limited to the first failure,\n"
"  periodic summaries, and recovery events.\n"
"- Validate transfer accuracy and the logical-payload contract for newly supported NPU formats on the intended NPU and\n"
"  model combination; CPU tests cannot establish NPU storage correctness. This qualification is required when adding a\n"
"  format, but it is not a runtime requirement to copy allocator or descriptor padding outside a tensor's declared payload."
msgstr ""
"- RFork 在运行时需要 `YuanRong TransferEngine`。如果缺少该包，RFork 将无法初始化传输后端。\n"
"- 如果使用 RFORK，**每个工作进程**必须绑定一个监听端口。该端口是随机分配的。\n"
"- 在下列任一配置下，RFork 传输会被完全绕过 —— 模型通过默认加载器加载，且不会公布任何 seed。RFork 会注册活跃的 NPU 权重内存并将其提供给其他实例，因此当这部分内存之后可能被释放或改写，或者专家放置在加载时尚未固定时，就不能使用 RFork。绕过的判定发生在建立任何会话或 TransferEngine 之前，并记录为 `RFork transfer is disabled when <reason> is enabled; using the default model loader.`\n"
"    - **睡眠模式**（模型配置或 `vllm_config.model_config` 上的 `enable_sleep_mode`），因为进入睡眠会丢弃并重新分配权重存储。\n"
"    - **在线权重传输**（设置了 `weight_transfer_config`），因为权重在加载后可能被替换。\n"
"    - **静态专家放置**（设置了 `eplb_config.expert_map_path`），因为放置映射的生效范围在被传输的张量集合之外。\n"
"    - **动态 EPLB**，因为专家权重和放置位置可能在 seed 服务启动后发生变化。这涵盖 `parallel_config.enable_eplb`、`eplb_config.dynamic_eplb` 和 `eplb_config.expert_map_record_path`。\n"
"- 回退到默认加载器之前，必须先释放 RFork 的 seed 服务和已注册内存。RFork 会重试该清理（`FALLBACK_CLEANUP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`，当前为 2，并带有短暂退避），然后才回收内存并重新运行默认加载器。如果清理仍然失败，张量持有者会继续被占用，此时 RFork 会抛出异常，而不会再分配一份模型副本；已经进入 finalized 状态的会话同样会抛出异常。这两种情况都会中止启动，而不是退化为一次缓慢的加载。\n"
"- 示例 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) 仅是一个简单的模拟实现。如果您需要更强的调度、容量管理或生产级可用性行为，请基于 RFork seed 协议实现您自己的规划器。\n"
"- 规划器协议头 `SEED_REFCNT` 和 `SEED_RANK` 不携带任何调度含义，但目前在协议层面并非可选：\n"
"    - `SEED_REFCNT` 在公布 seed 时始终发送 `0`，并且不参与容量决策（seed 容量由规划器配置控制）。规划器仍必须接受该头。\n"
"    - `SEED_RANK` 仍是**必需**字段。如果 `/get_seed` 响应中缺少该头或其取值为负，RFork 会拒绝该响应；并且在每次公布 seed、续租、释放租约和移除 seed 的请求中都会发送它。规划器必须在 `/get_seed` 中回传该头，并在其他路由上接受它。被废弃的是将它用于兼容性判定：它只是重复了已编码进 seed 键的 `tp_rank`，因此规划器必须仅依据 seed 键进行匹配，并将 `SEED_RANK` 视为 seed 身份元组中一个不透明的组成部分。\n"
"- 每次心跳都会验证 seed HTTP 服务是否仍然存活。如果该服务退出，RFork 会停止心跳并尝试撤回公布，同时保持已加载的模型可用于推理。\n"
"- 规划器的临时故障不会中断推理。可重试的初始公布和租约释放会在后台继续，而规划器的永久性拒绝会阻止 seed 晋升。故障日志仅限于首次失败、周期性汇总和恢复事件。\n"
"- 对于新支持的 NPU 格式，请在目标 NPU 与模型组合上验证传输精度和逻辑载荷约定；CPU 测试无法确立 NPU 存储的正确性。新增格式时必须完成这项资格验证，但这并不意味着运行时需要复制张量声明载荷之外的分配器填充或描述符填充。"

msgid ""
"- Apply the same vLLM Ascend code to both the seed instance and the receiver instance.\n"
"- Restart the planner and all vLLM instances after changing RFork code, because existing seeds keep their old transfer metadata.\n"
"- Use a new `model_deploy_strategy_name` after changing model arguments or RFork code, so the planner does not match a receiver with an incompatible old seed.\n"
"- A successful TP0 RFork transfer logs elapsed time, bytes, chunks, and throughput at INFO. Other TP ranks and\n"
"  per-chunk details remain at DEBUG. The two fallback paths are logged differently: a plain seed miss logs\n"
"  `seed acquisition was unsuccessful; loading locally` (INFO on the summary rank, DEBUG elsewhere) and reports\n"
"  `source=local`, while a failed transfer logs `RFork transfer failed` at WARNING and reports `source=fallback`.\n"
"  Treat only the latter as a transfer defect."
msgstr ""
"- 对 seed 实例和接收方实例应用相同的 vLLM Ascend 代码。\n"
"- 更改 RFork 代码后重新启动规划器和所有 vLLM 实例，因为现有的 seed 会保留其旧的传输元数据。\n"
"- 更改模型参数或 RFork 代码后使用新的 `model_deploy_strategy_name`，这样规划器就不会将接收方与不兼容的旧 seed 匹配。\n"
"- TP0 上成功的 RFork 传输会以 INFO 记录耗时、字节数、分块数和吞吐量。其他 TP rank 以及每个分块的详细信息保持在 DEBUG 级别。两条回退路径的日志并不相同：单纯的 seed 未命中记录 `seed acquisition was unsuccessful; loading locally`（summary rank 为 INFO，其他 rank 为 DEBUG），并报告 `source=local`；而传输失败则以 WARNING 记录 `RFork transfer failed`，并报告 `source=fallback`。只有后者才应被视为传输缺陷。"
